                <invention-title lang="de">CODIERER, DECODIERER, CODIERUNGSVERFAHREN UND DECODIERUNGSVERFAHREN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">CODEUR, DÉCODEUR, PROCÉDÉ DE CODAGE ET PROCÉDÉ DE DÉCODAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ENCODER, DECODER, ENCODING METHOD, AND DECODING METHOD</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An encoder (100) includes a processor and memory. Using the memory, the processor determines an asymmetrical filter characteristic across a block boundary (S111), and performs deblocking filtering using the filter characteristic determined (S112). For example, when determining the filter characteristic, the processor may determine the filter characteristic such that a pixel which is more likely to have a large error with respect to an original image is more affected by the deblocking filtering.</p>
            </abstract>
